# Debian/Ubuntu family package for the gnome-extensions module (P6.3).
# Deliberately a single shared bundle: dash-to-dock ships as
# gnome-shell-extension-dashtodock on Debian but is absent under that and
# any standard dash-to-dock name on Ubuntu noble (packages.ubuntu.com has no
# such package; Ubuntu preinstalls its own ubuntu-dock), so a family-common
# dash-to-dock declaration would fail on one of the two. The
# gnome-shell-extensions bundle carries user-theme (and friends) on both
# distros, and user-theme is therefore enabled from the curated set only
# when its uuid is actually installed.
gnome-shell-extensions
